+- attempt 1 · gate.green FAIL at db4a04b (findings/A1.md) · 96/100 e2e: three A11Y-1 and one BUSY-1, all test sync
+  and harness; fixed in the tests per David's ruling (f11f331..5999192), then 100/100
+- attempt 2 · reviewer FAIL at 42047fa (verdicts/A2-reviewer.json) · R1 canned cancel/renew/claim (scope), R2 shell
